# NodeJS
node_modules/

# Project-specific
dist/
staging/

# Paper-driven backfill — regenerable intermediates.
reports/extractions/
reports/extraction-queue-*.json
reports/extraction-prompts-*.jsonl
reports/extracted-paper-fields-*.json
reports/extracted-paper-fields-*-spellcheck.md

# Generated on demand — derived purely from the data (run
# `npm run report-missing-fields` or the /report skill); not checked in.
reports/missing-fields.md

# Paper-watch digest — regenerable from OpenAlex (run `npm run paper-watch`).
reports/paper-watch.md
reports/paper-watch.json

# Notable-specimens backfill — flag-scan candidates for human review (working
# file, regenerable from the notable-specimens flag-scan workflow).
reports/notable-specimens-candidates.md

# Paper-watch incremental state — persisted between CI runs via actions/cache,
# never committed (and written locally by a dry run with --write-state).
.github/paper-watch/

